### ✅ Create a new account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/create?accountNumber=123&accountHolder=Ramesh

### ✅ Deposit money into account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/deposit?accountNumber=123&amount=500

### ✅ Withdraw money from account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/withdraw?accountNumber=123&amount=200

### ✅ Get account details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/details?accountNumber=123

### ✅ Delete account
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/remove?accountNumber=123
